# Codebase knowledge (maintained by /learn-codebase)

The verified map of this repository lives in `docs/codebase-knowledge/`. Start there
before exploring; it is faster and already cites file:line evidence.

@docs/codebase-knowledge/INDEX.md

When you learn something durable about this codebase (a concept, a flow step, a
rationale), add it to the matching file there with a `path:line` citation, and record
open questions in `docs/codebase-knowledge/90-questions.md`.
